title: "IVIA — AI Visibility Index"
abstract: "A two-layer framework for measuring the visibility of entities in AI-generated responses and traditional search results. Evaluates four dimensions: Presence (P), Frequency (F), Precision (PR), and Context (C) across two independent layers: CAPA_IVIA_IA (language models: ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini, Perplexity) and CAPA_IPS_SERP (search engines: Google, Bing). Part of the SAGEO methodology for digital visibility in generative AI environments."
version: "2.0"
date-released: 2026-05-12
license: CC-BY-4.0
